<p>When you teleport you fire a pulse that jolts enemies out of phase in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> around both the start and the destination point. </p><p>Each target has a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">4%, 6%, 8%, 10%, 12%</acronym> chance per tile you travelled to be stunned, blinded, confused, or pinned for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.</p>